    "detailed_description": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Wallbound</h2></strong><br><br><strong>About:</strong><br><br>You are a Test Subject, trapped in Chamber 7, with little chance of escape. You will have to dodge past all the obstacles that are in your way if you would like a chance to escape. You will be provided with some tools to aid you in your journey. You will receive: A grappling gun to swing past the enemies, A Pistol so you can defeat anyone who opposes you, and lastly, the ability to parkor. This skill will be crucial to your success, as you will have to run on walls, slide under obstacles, and sprint through rooms, while you are being fired at. Good Luck, and don't die.<br><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Wall Running<br></li><li>Sprinting<br></li><li>Climbing<br></li><li>Grappling and Swinging<br></li><li>Shooting<br></li><li>Sliding<br></li><li>And Much More</li></ul>",
